# Crazy AI & Robotics System

This project provides a lightweight foundation for building an autonomous AI robotics system.
It combines mission planning, sensor understanding, safety validation, and robot execution.

## Core modules

- `ai_robotics.agent`: command parsing and planning logic
- `ai_robotics.perception`: sensor snapshot creation and environment analysis
- `ai_robotics.safety`: collision and safety validation
- `ai_robotics.robot`: low-level robot control abstraction
- `ai_robotics.cli`: command-line interface for experimentation

## Basic usage

```bash
python -m ai_robotics.cli "navigate to the charging station"
```
